<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Hoogovens stake in Usines Gustave Boel.</title>
<headline>EU clears Hoogovens stake in Usines Gustave Boel.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared the acquisition by Dutch steel group Hoogovens NV of a 50 percent stake in Usines Gustave Boel of Belgium.</p>
</text>
